2. **Confirm the dates** (check‑in 2024‑12‑10, check‑out 2024‑12‑20).  
3. **Select a payment method** – all three hotels accept major credit cards and PayPal; The Hive adds Klarna for “pay‑later”, while Capo d’Africa and Palazzo Manfredi also allow “pay at hotel” (note the small surcharge at Capo d’Africa).  
4. **Book directly** on the hotel’s official website (fastest way to get the best rate and any special New‑Year’s offers) or through a trusted OTA (Booking.com, Expedia, etc.) using the same payment options.  

